	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Siedle In-Home bus gateway, interface board revision 1: a carrier for the ESP32 D1 Mini.\nPower from the bus through a gyrator, data in through comparators, data out through\ntwo pull-down transistors, audio through an ES8311 codec. Blocks connect through global\nlabels. Design notes: doc/PCB.md, doc/Bus-Power.md, doc/Audio.md.\n\nStatus: draft. Topology settled, many values provisional until the bus measurements\n(doc/Bus-Measurements.md) and the breadboard bring-up. Do not order yet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
